Comment: The application is linked against the LVGL based cp0_lvgl runtime of the
 CardputerZero launcher by M5Stack (Copyright M5Stack Technology CO LTD, MIT) and LVGL
 (Copyright LVGL Kft, MIT), which are part of the binary and are therefore listed in
 its Copyright field below. The fonts it draws with are the launcher's, read at run
 time from /usr/share/APPLaunch/share/font; none is shipped in this package. At run
 time it reads /proc and /sys and, when it is installed, runs iw (ISC); iw is not
 shipped in this package. The ping, DNS, TCP and HTTP clients are the app's own code.
 The captive-portal check requests http://connectivitycheck.gstatic.com/generate_204
 (a Google service) and the internet check sends ICMP echo requests to 1.1.1.1
 (Cloudflare) and 8.8.8.8 (Google), only when the user starts a diagnosis.

