Comment: net-toolbox-oui.tsv maps MAC address prefixes (OUI) to vendor names, shown by the
 Local devices tool (0.4). It is derived by tools/make_oui.py (apps/net-toolbox/tools/) from
 the public IEEE OUI listing published by the IEEE Registration Authority at
 https://standards-oui.ieee.org/oui/oui.csv. The prefixes are kept; the company names are
 shortened (corporate suffixes such as "Inc." or "Ltd." dropped, at most 30 characters) to fit
 the small screen, so the file is a modified, abridged derivative and not a copy of the listing
 as published. No other terms are claimed by the packager for this data.

